{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09644","headline":"使交河郡郡在火山脚其地苦热无雨雪献封大夫 · 岑参","name":"使交河郡郡在火山脚其地苦热无雨雪献封大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉使按胡俗，平明发轮台。\n暮投交河城，火山赤崔巍。\n九月尚流汗，炎风吹沙埃。\n何事阴阳工，不遣雨雪来。\n吾君方忧边，分阃资大才。\n昨者新破胡，安西兵马回。\n铁关控天涯，万里何辽哉。\n烟尘不敢飞，白草空皑皑。\n军中日无事，醉舞倾金罍。\n汉代李将军，微功合可咍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}